// With no lava or fire in reach, the forge burns a coal (or charcoal) from the pack per job: that is how
// the first copper is smelted. With no fuel at all it's cold and refuses.
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#...................@............................#
##################################################
##################################################
end
give Stone 10
give Clay 4
give CopperOre 6
give Coal 2
mode survival
station 2 2 0 Forge
craft 4 Copper_ingot
expect 5 inv:CopperIngot == 1
expect 5 inv:Coal == 1                 // one coal burnt
craft 6 Copper_ingot
expect 7 inv:CopperIngot == 2
expect 7 inv:Coal == 0
craft 8 Copper_ingot
expect 9 inv:CopperIngot == 2          // cold now: no fuel left
expect 9 inv:CopperOre == 2
